Primary Textual Sources & Editions:
1. English Translation & Plates Metadata:
   Vitruvius, The Ten Books on Architecture, translated by Morris Hicky Morgan,
   prepared under the direction of Herbert Langford Warren (Cambridge: Harvard
   University Press, 1914, pp. 3–319). Public Domain.
2. Original Latin Text:
   Vitruvii De Architectura Libri Decem, edidit F. Krohn (Leipzig: B. G. Teubner,
   1912), via Perseus Digital Library (urn:cts:latinLit:phi1056.phi001.perseus-lat2,
   CC BY-SA 3.0 US / Public Domain source edition).
3. Three.js WebGL Engine (vendor/three/):
